          <p class="page-intro">
            为出海租客精心梳理的 2026 全景导航卷宗。拒绝花里胡哨与虚假宣传，所有收录服务均经宿管大爷每周例行突击抓包抽检。从优质专线直达、全平台客户端安装，到网络丢包测试工具，一站直达！
          </p>

          <!-- Quick Jump Anchors -->
          <div class="nav-jump-bar font-mono">
            <span class="jump-label">快速跳转:</span>
            <a href="#featured" class="jump-pill">⭐ 免检精选机场</a>
            <a href="#budget" class="jump-pill">🚀 性价比推荐</a>
            <a href="#clients" class="jump-pill">💻 客户端下载</a>
            <a href="#diagnostics" class="jump-pill">📊 测速与诊断</a>
            <a href="#blacklist" class="jump-pill">🚨 跑路避坑专栏</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stamp-position">
            <StampWatermark text="查房导航·实测核准专章" size="sm" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 1: Featured Airports -->
        <section id="featured" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill red font-mono">⭐ 宿管免检</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🏆 2026 稳定优质专线机场直达导航</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              经 7×24 小时连续抓包与晚高峰严苛考验，连接稳定低丢包，适合主力工作、4K影音与跨境外贸。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="nav-cards-grid">
            {featuredAirports.map((item) => (
              <div class="nav-card industrial-box">
                <div class="nav-card-header">
                  <div class="nav-card-title-group">
                    <h3 class="nav-card-name">{item.name}</h3>
                    <span class="nav-type-tag font-mono">{item.type}</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class={`nav-badge-pill pill-${item.badgeType} font-mono`}>
                    {item.tag}
                  </span>
                </div>

                <p class="nav-card-desc">{item.desc}</p>

                <div class="nav-card-footer">
                  <span class="rating-box font-mono" title="宿管综合评分">
                    ★ {item.rating}
                  </span>
                  <div class="nav-btn-group">
                    <a href={item.reviewUrl} class="btn-review">
                      📖 详细实测
                    </a>
                    <a href={item.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-visit">
