            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              价格亲民、门槛低，适合学生党查阅文献、平时轻度出海或作为第二条备用防断流线路。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="nav-cards-grid budget-grid">
            {budgetAirports.map((item) => (
              <div class="nav-card industrial-box">
                <div class="nav-card-header">
                  <h3 class="nav-card-name">{item.name}</h3>
                  <span class="nav-badge-pill pill-orange font-mono">{item.tag}</span>
                </div>

                <p class="nav-card-desc">{item.desc}</p>

                <div class="nav-card-footer">
                  <a href={item.reviewUrl} class="btn-review">
                    实测卷宗
                  </a>
                  <a href={item.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-visit">
                    前往访问 ➔
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Client Downloads & Tutorials -->
        <section id="clients" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill dark font-mono">💻 必备工具</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🛠️ 全平台客户端官方下载与配置教程</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              工欲善其事，必先利其器。精选各操作系统下主流好用的开源代理客户端与本站图文配置教程。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="client-cards-grid">
            {clientTools.map((client) => (
              <div class="client-card industrial-box">
                <div class="client-top">
                  <span class="client-platform font-mono">{client.platform}</span>
                  <span class="client-badge font-mono">{client.badge}</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="client-name">{client.name}</h3>
                <p class="client-desc">{client.desc}</p>
                <div class="client-action">
                  <a href={client.tutorialUrl} class="btn-tutorial">
                    📖 查看新手配置教程 ➔
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Network Diagnostics & Speedtest -->
        <section id="diagnostics" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill green font-mono">📊 查房利器</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🔬 常用网络测速、路由追踪与 IP 纯净度工具</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              遇到断流卡顿先别慌，使用宿管大爷同款网络分析工具，轻松定位丢包与线路拥堵瓶颈。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="tools-list-grid">
            {diagnosticTools.map((tool) => (
              <a href={tool.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tool-item-card industrial-box">
                <div class="tool-title-row">
                  <span class="tool-icon font-mono">🌐</span>
                  <strong class="tool-name">{tool.name}</strong>
                  <span class="tool-arrow font-mono">↗</span>
                </div>
                <p class="tool-desc">{tool.desc}</p>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Scam / Blacklist Warning -->
        <section id="blacklist" class="nav-section">
          <div class="warning-callout-card industrial-box">
            <div class="warning-header">
              <span class="warning-siren">🚨</span>
              <h3 class="warning-title">宿管防踩坑告示：警惕低价跑路与虚标陷阱</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="warning-text">
              近年来“包年9.9元”、“无限流量”等营销噱头层出不穷，很多服务商圈钱数月后便拔线提桶跑路。宿管大爷提醒大家：<strong>切记首选月付</strong>，保留测试凭据，定期关注本站「跑路机场」黑榜卷宗！
            </p>
            <div class="warning-actions font-mono">
              <a href="/category/meishou" class="btn-danger">
                🚨 查看「跑路机场」拉闸避坑卷宗 ➔
              </a>
              <a href="/category/zhuabao" class="btn-neutral">
                🔍 查阅「机场评测」实测抓包数据 ➔
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Sidebar Column -->
      <aside class="right-sidebar-column">
        <RightNav activeId="01" title="⚡ 热门机场速览" />

        <!-- Sidebar Bulletin Card -->
        <div class="sidebar-info-card industrial-box">
          <div class="info-card-header">
            <span class="badge-tag font-mono">宿管公告</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono">LIVE</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="info-title">💡 导航使用小贴士</h4>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>所有机场均提供 7×24 小时每周巡检报告。</li>
            <li>建议将本站加入书签，防备节点突发失联。</li>
            <li>遇紧急故障可查阅对应的客户端错误码排查。</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="info-footer">
